purpose: Cluster-level read-only collection with a local admin kubeconfig (or --kubeconfig): get all/events -A -o yaml, nodes, namespaces, RBAC, service accounts, webhooks, CRDs, secrets (content), configmaps, pod logs incl. --previous.
